+Fix the solution file at {solution_path} with the editor tool so that all samples and differential tests pass.
+Re-run the samples with bash. Do not reply with text only.
+""", model=self.code_model, msg_history=[], logging=safe_log)
+            ok, report = self._checkpoint(solution_path)
